1
00:00:04,185 --> 00:00:06,395
What happened with Leslie?
Why did she dump you?

2
00:00:06,563 --> 00:00:11,273
(Howard:)I don't know. She just said,
"Howard, Mama's a rolling stone."

3
00:00:13,069 --> 00:00:16,489
(Howard:)Then her call waiting beeped,
and she was gone.

4
00:00:18,158 --> 00:00:19,488
(Sheldon:)I don't understand.

5
00:00:19,659 --> 00:00:22,079
(Sheldon:)If you were in a non-emotional
relationship...

6
00:00:22,245 --> 00:00:26,085
(Sheldon:)...then why are you having
what appears to be an emotional response?

7
00:00:26,249 --> 00:00:28,919
(Raj:)Sheldon,
he obviously had feelings for her.

8
00:00:29,085 --> 00:00:34,085
(Howard:)Of course I had feelings for her.
I saw her naked for God's sake.

9
00:00:34,591 --> 00:00:36,841
Okay, look,
you just need to get your mind off it.

10
00:00:37,010 --> 00:00:39,760
Do you wanna go to the comic-book store,
maybe see a movie?

11
00:00:39,929 --> 00:00:41,969
I don't wanna go anywhere.

12
00:00:42,140 --> 00:00:43,720
(Sheldon:)You know...

13
00:00:43,892 --> 00:00:47,182
(Sheldon:)...I'm given to understand
that there's an entire city in Nevada...

14
00:00:47,353 --> 00:00:52,103
(Sheldon:)...designed specifically to help people
like Howard forget their problems.

15
00:00:53,193 --> 00:00:55,903
We can replace them
with new problems such as alcoholism...

16
00:00:56,070 --> 00:01:01,020
(Sheldon:)...gambling addiction
and sexually-transmitted diseases.

